A.13 Theorem: Containment Tax Budget Feasibility

Theorem A.13. If the L3 evaluation overhead is bounded by $\epsilon_{\text{L3}}$ and the CTF delay is $T_{\text{slot}}$, then the containment tax at authority level $L_k$ satisfies:

\text{Tax}(L_k) \leq \frac{\epsilon_{\text{L3}} + T_{\text{slot}} \cdot \text{Throughput}(L_k)}{\text{TaskCost}(L_k)}

