Appendix F — Taint Epoch Revocation Protocol

F.1 Trigger

When confined(i, t) becomes TRUE:

```
1. Compute taint window: [t - T_taint, t]
   where T_taint = 15 min (token lifetime)

2. Query OAuth authorization server for all tokens issued to i
   in the taint window.

3. For each token, call introspection endpoint (RFC 7662):
   POST /introspect
   token=<token>
   
