Appendix H — Containment Tax Measurement Harness

H.1 Purpose

To enforce the Containment Tax Budget (§13.2) by measuring actual overhead during ACB evaluation.

H.2 Procedure

```
For each task T in ACB scenarios:
  1. Run T with authority level L0 (Observe)
     Record: tokens_L0, latency_L0, energy_L0

  2. Run T with authority level Lk (target)
     Record: tokens_Lk, latency_Lk, energy_Lk

  3. Compute overhead:
     overhead_tokens = (tokens_Lk - tokens_L0) / tokens_L0
     overhead_latency = (latency_Lk - latency_L0) / latency_L0
     overhead_energy = (energy_Lk - energy_L0) / energy_L0

  4. Compute composite overhead:
     overhead = max(overhead_tokens, overhead_latency, overhead_energy)

  5. Check: overhead <= budget(Lk)
     If FAIL: ladder promotion fails
```

